        "description": "Exclusion of drug-induced hypertrichosis",
        "category": "minor",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      },
      {
        "id": "histopathology",
        "description": "Skin biopsy showing increased lanugo hair follicles without folliculitis",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of adult-onset lanugo hair growth plus exclusion of congenital and drug-induced causes; identification of underlying malignancy supports diagnosis",
    "notes": "Often considered a paraneoplastic marker; thorough malignancy screening is recommended"
